APPENDIX — LIKELY QUESTIONS

Q: Is this real-time?
A: Live from SharePoint on each menu open. Manual Refresh re-reads everything. Not a streaming push — refresh on access.

Q: Who can see what?
A: Admin/CEO = all. Head Director = their verticals. AD = their accounts. AM = their book. Viewer = read-only all.

Q: Where does governance history come from?
A: SharePoint Version History API + Versions.aspx parsing. Same source as clicking "Version History" on a list item.

Q: Why current quarter in-flight only for governance?
A: Focuses cleanup on deals that affect this quarter's forecast. Lost/Cancelled/No Bid and wrong-quarter activations are excluded.

Q: Can we export?
A: Yes — pipeline grid, bridge PowerPoint, mobile product tables Excel, governance grid via AG Grid export.

Q: What if SharePoint is slow?
A: Governance caches version history in browser localStorage. Second visit is faster. Progress bar shows load status.



